  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2017/09/P1670366.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 360px;\" /></p>\n<p>(11 fotos) Operarios de la empresa de construcci&oacute;n familiar propietaria de las casas n&uacute;meros 14 y 16 de la calle Santa Ana de Onda han comenzado a reparareste martes de urgencia fachadas, balcones y voladizos <a href=\"http://www.eltriangulo.es/contenidos/?p=71163\" target=\"_blank\">para evitar m&aacute;s desprendimientos a la v&iacute;a p&uacute;blica</a>.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/reparencasacarrersantaanna/p1670353.jpg\" alt=\"p1670353\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/reparencasacarrersantaanna/p1670354.jpg\" alt=\"p1670354\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/reparencasacarrersantaanna/p1670356.jpg\" alt=\"p1670356\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/reparencasacarrersantaanna/p1670357.jpg\" alt=\"p1670357\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/reparencasacarrersantaanna/p1670358.jpg\" alt=\"p1670358\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/reparencasacarrersantaanna/p1670363.jpg\" alt=\"p1670363\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/reparencasacarrersantaanna/p1670365.jpg\" alt=\"p1670365\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/reparencasacarrersantaanna/p1670366.jpg\" alt=\"p1670366\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/reparencasa